    rdfs:label "Single version narrative" ;
    dcterms:description "Document (or fix) the active version scheme so package.json, AGENTS.md, and release docs do not contradict; either advance package.json to the calver wave or explicitly document the dual scheme with a bound subjectSha. Earns: VERSION_NARRATIVE_BOUND." .

